    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/a3f8757658830612e4322c9b586c7aa8.webp?t=1699408966\" /></span><br><i>Fabian, the Karian Empire's greatest warlord and most venerable nobleman, <br>was joined by six wicked companions known as the &quot;Six Devils.&quot;<br><br>Together, they murdered Altair II, the emperor, but he was soon defeated by the Imperial Army and killed in battle.<br><br>7 years later...<br><br>Under a false identity, Fabian's son sets out to uncover the truth behind his father's death!<br>The Emperor Killer. The Moon that Eclipsed the Sun. The Master of the Six Devils. The Name that Cannot Be Spoken...<br><br>Will Fabian's son be able to uncover the truth behind the Day of the Eclipse?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/a3f8757658830612e4322c9b586c7aa8.webp?t=1699408966\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Engage in intense Real-Time Turn-Based Combat Against Players Worldwide</strong></h2>Distinguish yourself while battling players from around the globe!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/6312135e5d821ac511aa40dee3cfacb0.poster.avif?t=1699408966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/6312135e5d821ac511aa40dee3cfacb0.webm?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/6312135e5d821ac511aa40dee3cfacb0.mp4?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Experience Stunning Artwork and Animations</strong></h2>Over 300 unique mercenaries with unique skills<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/64b7ae6e06616633ffd27e35e219a0ff.poster.avif?t=1699408966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/64b7ae6e06616633ffd27e35e219a0ff.webm?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/64b7ae6e06616633ffd27e35e219a0ff.mp4?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Embark on a Gripping Storyline</strong></h2>Delve into captivating chapters filled with engaging storylines, revealing the depths of a mesmerizing fantasy world with every episode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/f86b24959dbcc309249b55ea3a84d03b.poster.avif?t=1699408966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/f86b24959dbcc309249b55ea3a84d03b.webm?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/f86b24959dbcc309249b55ea3a84d03b.mp4?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Challenge Your Tactical Skills in Deep Gameplay</strong></h2>Build the ultimate formation to defeat your opponents and demonstrate your mastery<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/3df0c90b2a07de4dffc885c6650391b2.poster.avif?t=1699408966\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442230/extras/3df0c90b2a07de4dffc885c6650391b2.webm?t=1699408966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s